      "content": "Based on the information provided, both Student A and Student B have remarkably similar profiles, showing healthy academic standing and attendance with only one minor disciplinary incident. Since the behavioral notes are identical, the current data does not offer a strong basis for prioritizing one student over the other. Further information, such as more detailed behavioral observations or teacher feedback, would be necessary to make an informed decision for proactive intervention.",
